      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "我が港町はフォドラとの交易が盛んでね。\nそれで、あっちには芸術って奴があるって知ったよ。\nウチの町にもそいつを呼び込みたい。まずは\n美しい舞で芸術の風を吹かせてくれ。頼んだぜ。",
        "official_en": "Our port town does thriving trade with Fódlan. I hear\nthere's wonderful art there, and I'd like to bring the\nwinds of art to our town as well. Would you dance\nhere to inspire us all?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
