      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "自分の見込み違いだったようだ……\n芸術の風どころか嵐が吹いたな！\n舞台の熱気がまだ町に漂っているみたいだ。\n最高の一時だった。また是非頼むよ。",
        "official_en": "I had it wrong... You brought not just a wind, but a\nSTORM of art! The heat from your fiery performance\nis still radiating through town... Incredible.",
